  "2026-10-23T14:23:47.925Z",codex-agent,"Validation complete: all four pm-linked commands passed through pm test --run --progress: adoption 44/44, regex/performance 8/8, executable workflow 4/4, packed CLI dispatch 1/1. Additional selector/fidelity sweep passed 80/80. All prior review inputs remain, with explicit opt-in and anchored-policy refusal expectations. New seed 0x53ce71a9 generates 4096 repository/number/decoration/encoding samples checked in all three fields (12288 cases). Default-off modes preserve local fields/status; closed incidental items remain closed. Scoped coverage found no uncovered new-helper branches."
